<title>USA: Lord Abbett Research sets class A qtly div.</title>
<headline>Lord Abbett Research sets class A qtly div.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lord Abbett Research Fund Inc Large Cap Series Class A said it declared a quarterly dividend of $0.032 per share.</p>
<p>The latest dividend is payable March 17 to shareholders of record on March 11.</p>
<p>The prior dividend paid was a quarterly dividend of $0.06 per share and a capital gains distribution of $0.95 per share.</p>
</text>
